cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use Harness Lab in your research, please cite it as below.
type: software
title: "Harness Lab: controlled experiments for AI coding-agent harnesses"
abstract: >-
  A local-first experimentation platform for evaluating AI coding-agent harnesses. The same task,
  from the same commit, runs through Claude Code, the Codex CLI or any other agent in isolated git
  worktrees; an independent verifier with hidden tests decides success, and runs are compared on
  verified success, cost, tokens, LLM calls and behaviour with paired, task-level statistics.
authors:
